\n  \"Projects\".\n- Given the user navigates to the projects section, when the page renders,\n  then all page headings that previously read \"Data Science Projects\" read\n  \"Projects\".\n- Given a search of the Dashboard codebase for user-facing occurrences of\n  the old label, when the rename is complete, then no user-visible\n  occurrence of \"Data Science Projects\" remains (test IDs, routes, and\n  technical identifiers are unaffected).\n- Given the affected documentation topics, when they are reviewed, then\n  captions and references that mention the old label are updated to\n  \"Projects\".\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P2): Dashboard navigation and page headings show \"Projects\" instead\n  of \"Data Science Projects\" — covered by the UI string replacement in Scope.\n- HLR-2 (P2): Documentation screenshots' captions and references to the old\n  label are updated in the affected topics — covered by the documentation\n  touch-ups in Scope.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18873,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b59d54b64751dfb8","agent_id":"a265285372d3fc794","session_id":"c0a807e0-2954-4d73-89a8-03ac7ee01f57","uuid":"22522df4-ee9f-42b3-bcd3-ef44a836e790","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:50:47.239Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9009"}
